Given $\gamma^{(0)}_{ij}$, the higher-order terms in the expansion can be solved order by order from the Ricci-flatness condition of the ambient metric. For $k\geqslant 2$, each $\gamma^{(k)}_{ij}(x)$ has a pole at $d=2k$.

